sm:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl bg-card p-8 shadow-sm sm:p-12 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Community</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl\">Built with communities, for communities</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground\">Korot helps people discover, learn, and preserve indigenous language knowledge — one word, one translation, one contribution at a time.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center\"><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary\">—</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Languages</p></div><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary\">—</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Categories</p></div><div><p class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary\">—</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Words</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container-koro pb-20\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-14 text-center text-primary-foreground\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl\">Start Exploring</h2><p class=\"max-w-md text-primary-foreground/85\">No account needed to browse. Create one only when you&#x27;re ready to save words and build your own books.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-accent text-accent-foreground hover:bg-accent-hover shadow-sm h-13 px-7 text-base\" href=\"/dictionary\">Explore Dictionary <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\"